    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS proudly present this superb two-bedroom, two-bathroom second-floor apartment to the market in the ever-popular and secure gated development of Clearstream Court, Finglas, Dublin 11. No. 53 comes to the market in excellent condition throughout and offers bright, spacious accommodation.\n\nExtending to approximately 66 sq.m, this well-proportioned apartment is designed with modern living in mind. The accommodation comprises of a welcoming entrance hallway, a bright and spacious open-plan living, dining and fully fitted kitchen area with direct access to a private balcony, two generous double bedrooms with built-in wardrobes, including a master bedroom complete with an ensuite bathroom, and a modern family bathroom. The property further benefits from gas-fired central heating, double glazed windows throughout, a BER B rating for excellent energy efficiency, and a secure designated underground parking space.\n\nClearstream Court is a well-maintained gated development offering residents both privacy and security while enjoying an exceptionally convenient location. A bus stop is situated directly outside the development, providing regular and reliable public transport to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas. The development is also within easy reach of the M50 and M1 motorways, making commuting throughout Dublin and beyond effortless. Dublin Airport is only a short drive away, making this an excellent choice for frequent travellers and airport employees alike.\n\nThe area is exceptionally well serviced with an abundance of amenities on your doorstep. Charlestown Shopping Centre, IKEA, Clearwater Shopping Centre and Finglas Village are all within minutes, offering a fantastic selection of supermarkets, retail stores, cafés, restaurants and essential services. There are numerous primary and secondary schools nearby along with DCU, making the location appealing to families and students alike. Outdoor enthusiasts can enjoy nearby parks including Tolka Valley Park and Albert College Park, while a range of sports clubs, gyms and recreational facilities are also close by. The proposed LUAS extension to Charlestown, located within walking distance, is set to further enhance connectivity and future value in the area.\n\nViewing is highly recommended. Contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today on 0861985247 or 015411455 to arrange a viewing or for further information.\n\nFeatures\n• c. 66 sq.m\n• BER B rating\n• Spacious second-floor apartment\n• Built 2007\n• Secure gated development\n• Management fee: Approx. 1,900 per annum\n• Two spacious double bedrooms with built-in wardrobes\n• Master bedroom with ensuite\n• Modern family bathroom\n• Bright open-plan living, dining and kitchen area\n• Fully fitted kitchen\n• Private balcony\n• Gas-fired central heating\n• Double glazed windows throughout\n• Secure designated underground parking space\n• Lift access\n• Bus stop located directly outside the development\n• Minutes from the M50, M1 and Dublin Airport\n• Close to Charlestown Shopping Centre, IKEA, DCU, Finglas Village, schools, parks and an excellent range of local amenities\n• Walking distance to the proposed LUAS extension\n"
      },
